  "description": "A Microsoft 365 style ribbon and control library for WPF on .NET 10. Provides the Word 365 window chrome (title bar with a Microsoft Search box, adaptive ribbon groups, KeyTips, contextual tabs, split buttons, galleries, ScreenTips and Backstage) on a light/dark/high-contrast palette, with right-to-left support, 24 UI Automation peers, a built-in Fluent icon catalog and no runtime dependencies.",
